  "product_contract": [
    "Known source enabled/disabled values, stable layout and register availability are required before ENABLE.",
    "Source enabled values and exact conflicting DISABLE rejection on a separate temporary owned object are required. The probe is freed and enabled values are checked again.",
    "Register transitions are recorded separately from arbitration evidence; already-enabled baseline need not change.",
    "Duplicate same-mode Hold rereads without writes; opposite modes require explicit Release.",
    "Release/free affects only owned objects, with no registry writes, restart persistence or saved-profile replay.",
